+
+# Product analytics vendor: PostHog Cloud (EU region)
+
+Agreed on 2026-10-14 by [[Maya Okafor]] and [[Tom Lindqvist]].
+
+## Decision
+Product analytics vendor is **PostHog Cloud in the EU region**.
+
+## Why
+Self-hosting PostHog is taking too much operations time while clinic data must remain in the EU.
+
+This replaces [[Decision - Product analytics vendor is PostHog self-hosted]], which is no longer current.
